<p>If you run a kitchen & bath showroom or design studio in Las Vegas, Pinnacle Sales gives you a portfolio that spans every market tier — from semi-custom value for the Valley's new construction to handleless German luxury for Summerlin, The Ridges, and MacDonald Highlands — backed by 23+ years of hands-on dealer support. We offer protected territory, line training, and the design and merchandising help your team needs to win high-end Valley projects.</p>

