<h2 id="las-vegas-market-opportunity">The Las Vegas Market Opportunity</h2>
<p>From Summerlin and The Ridges to Henderson and MacDonald Highlands, Las Vegas kitchens skew contemporary and high-contrast — sleek, finished, and made for entertaining. Demand favors flat-slab and frameless fronts, dramatic stone, integrated lighting, and bold two-tone or monochrome palettes suited to the Valley's modern architecture. The luxury master-planned communities increasingly spec handleless <a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens">Pronorm</a> and seamless <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">frameless</a> kitchens — a high-margin opportunity for dealers carrying the right lines.</p>

<h2 id="dealer-support">Dealer Support That Drives Sales</h2>
